---
description: Claude Code attribution footers are not allowed in commits, pull requests, or comments.
alwaysApply: true
---

Do not add Claude Code attribution. These are not allowed in commit messages, pull request titles or descriptions, code comments, or review comments:

- `_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code/session_...)_` (any session id)
- `🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)`
- `https://claude.ai/code/session_...` links, including the shortened `claude.ai/code/…` form

If one is already present, remove it. Do not replace it with another attribution line.
